        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Attractions: Monsters, Inc. Mike & Sulley to the Rescue!\n- Films: Monsters, Inc.\n- Companies: Pixar, The Walt Disney Company\n- People: Steve Jobs\n- Places: Emeryville, California\n\nFacts:\n- Monsters, Inc. is a 2001 Disney·Pixar film.\n- Monsters, Inc. Mike & Sulley to the Rescue! is based on the 2001 Disney·Pixar film Monsters, Inc.\n- Monsters, Inc. Mike & Sulley to the Rescue! opened on January 22, 2006 with a grand Sulley-Blue-Fur Carpet Premiere.\n- Pixar, also referred to as Pixar Animation Studios, is an American computer animation film studio based in Emeryville, California and is a subsidiary of The Walt Disney Company.\n- The Walt Disney Company purchased Pixar in 2006 at a valuation of $7.4 billion.\n- The Walt Disney Company’s 2006 purchase of Pixar made Steve Jobs Disney's largest single shareholder at the time.",
